WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:03.260
We are the beginning!

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:04.220
And the end!

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:08.380
Apes... together... strong

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.080
You...

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:21.780
...must go

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:23.960
Before...

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:26.020
...fighting begins

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:29.025
I'm sorry

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.080
War...

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.060
...has...

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:36.520
...begun

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:05.320
I...

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:08.260
...did not start this war

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:15.980
I offered you...

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:17.040
...peace

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.560
I showed you mercy

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:30.260
But now you are here...

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:34.060
...to finish us off...

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:36.440
...for good

00:01:58.100 --> 00:01:59.880
All of human history...

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:03.440
...has led to this moment

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.360
The irony is we created you...

00:02:14.445 --> 00:02:17.475
...and Nature has been punishing us ever since

00:02:21.745 --> 00:02:23.745
This is our last stand

00:02:27.645 --> 00:02:28.855
And if we lose...

00:02:36.565 --> 00:02:38.045
...it will be...

00:02:38.715 --> 00:02:40.885
...a planet of apes

